diagnostic_evidence.quote:
For every compact \(K\Subset\Omega_R\),
\begin{equation}
  \|u-u_\sigma^c\|_{H^1(K)}
  \le C_K\left(\mathcal P(\bar\sigma)e^{-c\bar\sigma}
    +\mathcal P(\bar\sigma)e^{-Z(L_2+d_2)}\right)
  \|g\|_{Y_R'} .
\end{equation}

If \(u\) is the outgoing solution of \eqref{eq:phys-pde}--\eqref{eq:phys-src} and \(u_\sigma\) is the Neumann PML solution, then, for every compact set \(K\Subset\Omega_p\),
\begin{equation}
  \|u-u_\sigma\|_{H^1(K)}
  \le C_K \mathcal P(\bar\sigma)\left(e^{-c_0k\bar\sigma}+e^{-Z(L_2+d_2)}\right)\|g\|_{Y_R'} .
\end{equation}
